
---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Smruti Ranjan Behera">
  <article class="about-page">
    <header class="about-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">About Me</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        DevOps Engineer | Cloud Infrastructure | Automation
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-content">
      <p>
        I'm a DevOps professional with 15+ years of experience
        building, automating, and operating infrastructure and
        software delivery platforms.
      </p>

      <p>
        Throughout my career, I've worked across cloud infrastructure,
        CI/CD automation, distributed systems, and platform operations.
        I enjoy solving complex infrastructure challenges and building
        reliable, scalable engineering solutions.
      </p>

      <h2>Professional Background</h2>

      <p>
        My experience includes working with Microsoft Azure,
        Jenkins, Terraform, Linux, Service Fabric, and container
        technologies. I've been involved in infrastructure
        automation, CI/CD platform engineering, cloud operations,
        and troubleshooting production environments.
      </p>

      <h2>Technical Interests</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>Cloud infrastructure and Azure architecture</li>
        <li>DevOps automation and CI/CD engineering</li>
        <li>Infrastructure as Code using Terraform</li>
        <li>Linux, networking, and operating systems</li>
        <li>Containers and Kubernetes</li>
        <li>Monitoring, observability, and reliability</li>
        <li>System design and distributed systems</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Currently Learning</h2>

      <p>
        Technology evolves continuously, and I believe in
        learning by building and experimenting. My current
        learning focus includes:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>Kubernetes and cloud-native architecture</li>
        <li>Advanced system design and architecture patterns</li>
        <li>Linux internals and networking fundamentals</li>
        <li>Artificial intelligence and its applications in DevOps</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Beyond Work</h2>

      <p>
        Outside engineering, I enjoy fitness, running, and
        continuously exploring new technologies. I also use
        this website to document technical problems, solutions,
        experiments, and lessons learned along the way.
      </p>

      <h2>Why This Website?</h2>

      <p>
        This website is my personal engineering space. It brings
        together my professional experience, technical projects,
        and articles on technologies and engineering practices
        that I find interesting.
      </p>

      <p>
        My goal is to share practical knowledge, document
        real-world engineering experiences, and keep learning
        through building and writing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }

  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .page-title {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 2.25rem;
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-content {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-content h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .about-content ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
  }
</style>
